    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 20]\ntheorem green_29 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔\n      ∃ C c : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ 0 < c ∧\n        ∀ {G : Type*} [Group G] [DecidableEq G] (K : ℝ) (A : Finset G),\n          1 ≤ K → IsApproximateSubgroup K (A : Set G) →\n            ∃ S ⊆ A, C * K ^ (-c) * (A.card : ℝ) ≤ (S.card : ℝ) ∧\n            S ^ 8 ⊆ A ^ 4",
